    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Yosia ayeta abagurusi bona ba Yuda na Yerusalemu, bahurura bamugoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agya Rwensinga y'Omukama, abantu bona ba Yuda n'abanyansi bona ba Yerusalemu, n'abakuhani n'abarangi, embaga yona, abake n'abahango, bagenda nawe. Abashomera Ekitabo kyona ky'Endagano ekyashangirwe Rwensinga y'Omukama, babihulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia ayemelera aha nyomyo, akora endagano omu maisho g'Omukama okwo aramuhuliraga, n'okukwata emihangoye n'emikuye n'ebiragirobye, kubikwata n'omutimagwe gwona n'omwoyogwe gwona, kugobesheleza ebigambo by'endagano ebihandikirwe omu kitabo ekyo. Endagano egyo abantu bona bagikiliza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama aragira Hilikia Omukuhani Nyamukuru, n'abakuhani abamuhonderaga omu bukuru, n'abalinzi, n'abakumilizi b'ekishasi, kwihya omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama ebikwato byona bya Baali, n'ebya Ashera, n'eby'enyanyinyi zona. Akabyokeza enjai ya Yerusalemu omuli Kidironi; eijwi lyabyo yalitwara Betheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaihya aha ntebe abakuhani b'ekitakansi abo abakuhani ba Yuda babaire batendekire kwotera obunuma omu buju bw'omu bigo bya Yuda na bwatana Yerusalemu. Kwakwo n'abayoteraga Baali obunuma, bakabwotera n'eizoba n'okwezi n'enyanyinyi zona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aihya ekishushani kya Ashera Rwensinga, akiturukya Yerusalemu aheru, akitwara aha Kaiga ka Kidironi aba niho akyokeza, akichebacheba eba chuchu n'echuchu agimamilira aha bituro by'abantu aba buli kiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaju g'ensiyaga agabaire gali Rwensinga agatema, omu maju ago nimwo abakazi barukiraga entimbe za Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuhani bona omu bigo bya Yuda abashohoza. Obuju mbali abakuhani bayoteraga obunuma, kwema Geba kugoba Beerisheba abuhagaza. Akambura n'obuju bw'aha bihigi eby'ekishasi ky'ekihigi kya Yoshua gavana w'ekigo ekyabaire kili aha bumosho bw'ekihigi ky'ekigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abakuhani ab'obuju tibagobaga ahali ealutare ya Mukama omuli Yerusalemu, shana balyaga omukate ogutatumbisiibwe omuli barumuna babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahagaza Tofeti omu Ruhanga rwa Batabani ba Hinomu, omuntu ataija akokezaho mutabani anga muhara kutambira Moleki ekitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaihyaho efarasi ez'abakama ba Yuda babaire bahongeire eizoba aha kishasi kya Rwensinga bwatana aha kiyumba kya Natanimeleki omusigire mukuru, omu ruhuba. Yayokya n'amagali g'eizoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ealutare ez'aha rushwi rw'ekiyumba kya Ahazi omu gorofa, ekyabaire kyombekirwe abakama ba Yuda, na ealutare ezo Manase yabaire ayombekire nyakabuga zombili za Rwensinga akazigwisa yazishekashekenyura, eitaka yalishabura omu Kaiga ka Kidironi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahagaza obuju obwabaire buli oburugaizoba bwa Yerusalemu kugoba kasi k'Eibanga ly'Eisiliika elyo Solomoni omukama wa Isiraeli yabaire ayombekeireho Ashitoreti, ekinyamunuge ky'Abasidoni, na Kemoshi ekinyamunuge kya Moabu, na Milikomu ekinyamunuge ky'Abaamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomyo azishekashekenyura, ebishushani bya Ashera abikambura bigwa, mbali byabaire bili ahaijuza amagufa g'abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ealutare ya Betheli n'akaju akabaire kombekirwe Yeroboamu eya Nebati, ayafakaize Isiraeli, akabikambulirana, amabare yagatayata, yagasa gaba chuchu, n'ekishushani kya Ashera yakitaho omuliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia kayabaire nagaruka abona ebituro aha ibanga. Aragira kabaziikura amagufa omu bituro ebyo, agokeza aha ealutare, agihagaza nk'okwo Omukama Ruhanga yabaire agambiire omu kanwa k'omurangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abaza ati, “Akaijukiro kalinya ako ndikubona kaki?” Abanyakigo bamuhorora bati, “Kituro ky'omushaija wa Ruhanga ayarugire Yuda akaranga ebigambo ebi ebyo wakora ealutare ya Betheli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Yosia agamba ati, “Mumuleke; amagufage omuntu atagaziikura.” Kityo bagaleka, hamoi n'ag'omurangi ayarugire Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Yosia aihyamu obuju bwona omu bigo bya Samaria obwo abakama ba Isiraeli babaire bombekire bakanigaza Omukama. Akabukora nk'okwo yakozire obwa Betheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuhani bona b'obuju obwo ababaire baliho abaitira ealutare, mara ealutare ezo ashuba azokezaho amagufa g'abafu. Nirwo yagarukire Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Yosia aragira abantu bona ati, “Mushemeze Pasika y'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu, nk'okwo kihandikire omu Kitabo eki ky'Endagano.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Pasika eyab'egi ekaba etakashemezibwaga kwema ebiro by'abaramuzi abaramuraga Isiraeli, anga omu makiro g'abakama ba Isiraeli anga ag'abakama ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munana Omukama Yosia aliire engoma, Pasika egi bakagishemeleza Omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia wenene aihyamu embandwa ezilikugambisa emizimu, n'abarogi, n'eterafimu, n'ebihuuku, n'ebinyamunuge ebyabaire bili omu nsi ya Yuda na Yerusalemu, abone kuhamisa Amateka agabaire gahandikire omu kitabo ekyo Hilikia omukuhani Nyamukuru yashangire Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama ow'okugaruka ahali Ruhanga n'omutimagwe gwona, n'omwoyogwe gwona, n'obushoborabwe bwona, nakwata Amateka ga Musa nka Yosia akaba atakabonekaga, n'ow'okumuruga enyuma akamushusha tiyazokire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'orwo byabaire bityo Ruhanga tiyalekeire kunigalira muno Yuda, nabatura ebyo Manase yakozire akamutamisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Ruhanga agamba ati, “Yuda ninyija kugichwa nk'okwo nafurwire Isiraeli, n'ekigo kyonaronkire eki ekya Yerusalemu, na Rwensinga eyo nagambire nti, ‘Nditura omwo,’ mbihyemu emikono.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu ebindi ebyo Yosia yakozire, bihandikirwe omu Kitabo ky'Amakuru g'Abakama ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu birobye, Farao Neko omukama wa Misiri agya ow'omukama wa Siria aha Mwiga gwa Efurati kumujuna. Omukama Yosia atabara kumurashanisa; kyonkai Farao Neko kayamuboine amwitira Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaramatabe bamwihya Megido omutumbi, bamuleta Yerusalemu omu gali, bamubyalira omu nyangaye. Abanyansi bakwata omutabani Yehoahazi bamukora amajuta, bamuta aha ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahazi akalya engoma aina emyaka 23. Akagimaraho emyezi eshatu ayemire Yerusalemu. Nyina eibaralye ni Hamutali, muhara wa Yeremia owa Libuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahazi agokera Omukama, akora nka baish'enkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao Neko amukwata amufungira Libula omu nsi ya Hamati, ataikara Yerusalemu aha ngoma, n'ensi ya Yuda yagitaho omushoro gw'ekilo 3,400 z'efeza n'ekilo 34 z'ezahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao Neko akwata Eliakimu mutabani w'Omukama Yosia amuteka aha ngoma kusikira ishe. Amuhindura n'eibara amweta Yehoyakimu. Kandi Yehoahazi ogwo amwihyaho agaruka nawe Misiri, niyo yagwire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu aha Farao efeza n'ezahabu, kyonkai empiya ezo kwija kuzigobya nk'okwo Farao yabaire amuragiire azikoma aha banyansi. Abanyansi yabaihyaho efeza n'ezahabu, buli muntu okwo yabaire ashaliirwe, abone ez'okuha Farao Neko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu akatwara aina emyaka 25. Akamara emyaka 11 aha ngoma ayemire Yerusalemu. Nyina eibaralye ni Zebida muhara wa Pedaya owa Ruma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe yagokera Omukama, yarondolera kimoi baish'enkuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
